  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/97) by Paul Matthijsse (Bitbucket: [Paul Matthijsse](https://bitbucket.org/Paul Matthijsse), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHello, according to me something is wrong with the snapshots tool. When I click on the plus sign to make a first snapshot, it is labeled Snapshot 1 \\(as usual\\), but I can’t rename it at this point. Then I change exposure and take a second snapshot, now I can rename it to Expo. If I choose snapshot 1, nothing changes. Can’t delete \\(via the minus sign\\) that first snapshot.\n\nWhen I make more snapshots \\(b&w, saturated, etc.\\) it’s sluggish to switch between them, if they react at all.\n\n‌\n",
